el="alert-warning">Warning</span></p><p>Back up your saves.</p></div><div class="md-alert md-alert-caution" role="note"><p class="md-alert-title"><span data-md-label="alert-caution">Caution</span></p><p>Do not use online.</p></div><ul class="contains-task-list"><li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" disabled checked> Noclip</li><li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" disabled> Map</li></ul><p>The ending: <span class="md-spoiler" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Spoiler" data-md-label="spoiler">it was all a dream</span>.</p><details><summary>Changelog</summary><p>Fixed ziplines.</p></details><pre><code class="language-json">{ "Id": "AxelModMenu" }</code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Key</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>F1</td><td>Menu</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"`;

exports[`domain components render on the server > RankStamp · veteran 1`] = `"<span data-rank="veteran" class="inline-flex max-w-full items-center gap-1.5 rounded-sm border-2 font-display-caps tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap -rotate-4 select-none h-8 px-2 text-sm border-primary/70 text-primary animate-stamp"><span class="sr-only">Survivor rank<!-- -->: </span>Veteran</span>"`;

